latform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"Select **Root CA** and complete:"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"**CA Name**: `Acme Evaluation Root CA`."},"2160":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"**Subject**: organization and country details for your evaluation."},"2161":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: for example, one year from creation."},"2162":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: for example, 90 days, within the CA's lifetime."},"2163":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority","content":"The CA name becomes its `Common Name`. Keep the CA usages needed to sign certificates and CRLs."},"2164":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-25","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#review-and-create-the-ca","content":"Check the engine, algorithm, subject, root type and dates. Confirm creation and note the authority identifier so you can recognize it in the DMS or API."},"2165":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-26","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verify-the-result","content":"Open the new CA. It should appear active, show its certificate and allow access to **Issued Certificates**."},"2166":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-27","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verify-the-result","content":"Download or copy the authority's PEM certificate and save it as `ca.pem`. Check that the file contains the complete block, including `BEGIN CERTIFICATE` and `END CERTIFICATE`."},"2167":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-28","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#check-the-ca-certificate","content":"Run from the directory where you saved `ca.pem`:"},"2168":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-29","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#check-the-ca-certificate","content":"Check that the subject and issuer match the root you created, the dates include the current time, **Basic Constraints** contains `CA:TRUE` and **Key Usage** allows certificate signing. The last command should return `ca.pem: OK`."},"2169":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-30","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#check-the-ca-certificate","content":"You explicitly selected `ca.pem` as the trust anchor for this test. A valid self-signature does not install that trust in other consumers. See the openssl-verify reference for verification options."},"2170":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-31","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"If creation fails, check permissions, engine availability and the selected algorithm."},"2171":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-32","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"If OpenSSL cannot read the file, copy the complete PEM block again."},"2172":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-33","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"If signature or date checks fail, check that you downloaded this CA's certificate and that your computer's clock is correct."},"2173":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-34","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"PKI diagnostics covers issuance checks and cryptographic dependencies."},"2