,"url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Recogida mínima de evidencias"},"374":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"No puedo iniciar sesión"},"375":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Todo devuelve 403 o 5xx"},"376":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Un pod no está Ready"},"377":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos no llegan"},"378":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"379":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","content":"Empieza por localizar la capa que falla. Una respuesta del Gateway y un pod no preparado requieren evidencias distintas. Para emisión rechazada o resultados de validación, consulta el diagnóstico PKI; para enrolamiento, el diagnóstico EST."},"380":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Anota hora en UTC, usuario o principal, recurso, endpoint y resultado. Evita repetir una acción destructiva como revocación o eliminación."},"381":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Comprueba el código HTTP. Un 401 apunta a autenticación; un 403, a autorización; un 404, a ruta o recurso; un 5xx, al servicio o una dependencia."},"382":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Localiza pods no preparados, reinicios, eventos recientes y el estado del release."},"383":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Revisa su endpoint /health y sus logs en la misma ventana temporal. Después sigue la dependencia indicada: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, proveedor OIDC o motor criptográfico."},"384":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Para PKI, comprueba el certificado, la cadena, OCSP o CRL con el mismo tipo de cliente que utiliza producción."},"385":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Sustituye los marcadores por tu release, namespace y deployment reales."},"386":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Ejecuta también la prueba de conectividad del chart:"},"387":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"El test consulta la salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y comprueba que la UI devuelve HTML. Un test correcto confirma conectividad básica, no un flujo completo de emisión."},"388":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Los servicios del chart exponen sondas de inicio, disponibilidad y vida sobre /health. Un pod puede estar ejecutándose pero no recibir tráfico si la readiness probe falla."},"389":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si recibes un 401:"},"390":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"comprueba que la autoridad OIDC de la UI sea accesible desde el navegador;"},"391":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica emisor, audiencia y expiración del token;"},"392":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que el Gateway puede obtener las claves de la URI JWKS;"},"393":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa que la ruta pública e interna del proveedor apunten al mismo realm."},"394":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si el login termina pero las APIs devuelven 403:"},"395":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"inspecciona los claims reales del token;"},"396":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que coinciden con un principal activo;"},"397":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa las políticas concedidas al principal;"},"398":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica que authz alcanza PostgreSQL y su JWKS."},"399":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"En una instalación nueva, confirma que el Job de migración terminó. Ese Job crea esquemas, migra authz, precarga políticas y provisiona los principales definidos en services.authz.bootstrap."},"400":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"La autorización externa falla cerrada por defecto. Si authz no está disponible, las rutas protegidas se bloquean."},"401":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Localiza el pod y Service de authz."},"402":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba /health, logs y conexión a su base de datos."},"403":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Verifica el DNS y puerto configurados en externalAuthorization."},"404":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba que la ruta del check es /v1/ext\\_authz/check."},"405":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"No cambies a failOpen: true como solución permanente: permitiría tráfico sin autorización durante la caída."},"406":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Revisa primero kubectl describe pod. Las causas habituales son:"},"407":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"credenciales o DNS incorrectos para PostgreSQL o RabbitMQ;"},"408":{"id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[