ocs/es/platform/administration/access-control#reglas-http","content":"Reglas HTTP"},"445":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#políticas-incluidas","content":"Políticas incluidas"},"446":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Provisiona el primer administrador"},"447":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#prepara-el-proveedor-de-identidad","content":"Prepara el proveedor de identidad"},"448":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#configura-las-dos-validaciones-jwt","content":"Configura las dos validaciones JWT"},"449":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#instala-y-verifica-el-acceso-administrativo","content":"Instala y verifica el acceso administrativo"},"450":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#prueba-una-identidad-sin-privilegios","content":"Prueba una identidad sin privilegios"},"451":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#reduce-el-uso-del-administrador-de-bootstrap","content":"Reduce el uso del administrador de bootstrap"},"452":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#bootstrap-de-fastlane","content":"Bootstrap de Fastlane"},"453":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#diseña-roles-de-mínimo-privilegio","content":"Diseña roles de mínimo privilegio"},"454":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cambios-y-revocación-de-acceso","content":"Cambios y revocación de acceso"},"455":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#lista-de-comprobación-operativa","content":"Lista de comprobación operativa"},"456":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#diagnóstico","content":"Diagnóstico"},"457":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-401","content":"La respuesta es 401"},"458":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-403","content":"La respuesta es 403"},"459":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-28","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#todo-devuelve-403","content":"Todo devuelve 403"},"460":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-29","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#todo-falla-cuando-authz-no-está-disponible","content":"Todo falla cuando authz no está disponible"},"461":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-30","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","content":"El control de acceso de Lamassu transforma una identidad autenticada en permisos concretos. El proveedor OIDC o el certificado cliente demuestra **quién** realiza una petición; el servicio `authz` decide **qué puede hacer** esa identidad y **sobre qué recursos**."},"462":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-31","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","content":"Lamassu no asigna permisos directamente a usuarios. La cadena completa es:"},"463":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-32","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","content":"Este modelo permite representar personas, grupos del proveedor de identidad, cuentas de servicio y dispositivos sin acoplar la autorización a un proveedor concreto."},"464":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-33","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#conceptos-esenciales","content":"Un **principal** conecta una credencial con Lamassu. Define cómo reconocer una identidad OIDC o X.509 y puede estar activo o desactivado."},"465":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-34","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#conceptos-esenciales","content":"Una **política** agrupa permisos reutilizables. Puede concederse a varios principales y puede contener reglas sobre entidades de Lamassu, reglas sobre rutas HTTP o ambas."},"466":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-35","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#conceptos-esenciales","content":"Una **regla de entidad** concede acciones sobre recursos como autoridades certificadoras, certificados, perfiles de emisión, dispositivos, DMS, claves o suscripciones de alertas. Puede abarcar todos los recursos de un tipo o limitarse por identificador, relación o atributo."},"467":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-36","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#conceptos-esenciales","content":"Una **regla HTTP** concede acciones asociadas a rutas de una API. Es el mecanismo que utiliza el Gateway para decidir si una petición puede atravesar el perímetro."},"468":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-37","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#conceptos-esenciales","content":"Un **grant** es la asociación entre un principal y una política. Quitar el grant elimina todos los permisos aportados por esa política, sin modificarla para los demás principales."},"469":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-38","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#conceptos-esenciales","content":"Un JWT válido o un certificado cliente válido no concede acceso por sí mismo. La credencial debe coincidir con al menos un principal activo y alguna de sus políticas debe permitir la operación solicitada."},"470":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-39","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#dos-sistemas-de-decisión","content":"Lamassu utiliza dos caminos de autorización según quién implementa el servicio protegido. Comparten principales, políticas y grants, pero no interpretan las reglas de la misma manera."},"471":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-40","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#dos-sistemas-de-decisión","content":"Un servicio externo puede quedar protegido sin conocer el modelo interno de autorización de Lamassu. Un servicio desarrollado por Lamassu integra el motor de autorización y puede decidir sobre recursos concretos y filtrar sus consultas."},"472":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-41","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Este camino protege APIs que se incorporan a la plataforma a través del Gateway pero que no implementan de forma nativa el SDK de autorización de Lamassu. Job Manager es el ejemplo actual. El mismo patrón permite integrar otros servicios HTTP siempre que sus rutas estén descritas en un esquema HTTP de `authz`."},"473":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-42","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"La decisión se toma **antes de reenviar la petición al servicio**:"},"474":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-43","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Envoy Gateway autentica la petición, normalmente validando un JWT contra el JWKS del proveedor OIDC."},"475":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-44","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Para una ruta protegida, Envoy envía el método, la URL, las cabeceras y los datos necesarios a `/v1/ext_authz/check`."},"476":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-45","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"`authz` extrae la credencial y resuelve todos los principales activos que coinciden con ella."},"477":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-46","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Carga por separado las políticas concedidas a cada principal."},"478":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-47","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"El esquema HTTP traduce la combinación de método y ruta a una acción lógica, como `nbi-job-read` o `nbi-workflow-create`."},"479":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-48","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"`authz` busca una regla HTTP que conceda esa acción."},"480":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-49","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Si la ruta declara restricciones, compara datos de la petición con los atributos normalizados del mismo principal que aporta la política."},"481":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-50","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Un resultado satisfactorio permite a Envoy reenviar la petición; cualquier otra respuesta la bloquea en el Gateway."},"482":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-51","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Cuando permite el acceso, `authz` devuelve el principal seleccionado en `x-current-user`. El Gateway puede propagar esa cabecera al servicio para conservar el contexto de identidad."},"483":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-52","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-http-integrados-o-externos","content":"Las reglas HTTP responden principalmente a &#x2A;*“¿puede esta identidad llamar a esta operación de la API?”**. Por sí solas no generan filtros sobre la base de datos del servicio externo. Para limitar una ruta a un dispositivo, tenant o cliente concreto, el esquema debe declarar una restricción que relacione un valor de la petición con un atributo normalizado del principal."},"484":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-53","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"Los servicios nativos de Lamassu integran autorización en su middleware y conocen las entidades sobre las que operan: certificados, CAs, perfiles de emisión, claves, dispositivos, DMS o suscripciones, entre otras."},"485":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-54","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"La decisión se toma con el contexto de la operación de dominio:"},"486":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-55","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"El middleware extrae la credencial y resuelve los principales coincidentes."},"487":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-56","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"El endpoint identifica la acción, el tipo de entidad y, cuando corresponde, la clave del recurso solicitado."},"488":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-57","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"`authz` reúne las reglas de entidad de las políticas concedidas."},"489":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-58","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"El motor evalúa grants directos, filtros por atributos y relaciones con otras entidades."},"490":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-59","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"Para una operación individual, comprueba que el recurso concreto satisface el alcance calculado."},"491":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-60","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"Para un listado, genera un filtro SQL que el servicio añade a su propia consulta."},"492":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-61","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"Aquí el motor responde a &#x2A;*“¿puede esta identidad realizar esta acción sobre este recurso concreto?”**."},"493":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-62","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"Las acciones se dividen en dos grupos:"},"494":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-63","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"Las **acciones globales** no necesitan un identificador de recurso. `create`, `import` o el acceso a una sección de la interfaz son ejemplos habituales."},"495":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-64","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"Las **acciones atómicas** se evalúan sobre una instancia concreta. En certificados aparecen `read`, `metadata-update`, `status-update` y `delete`; para una CA también existen `sign`, `reissue` y otras operaciones de ciclo de vida."},"496":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-65","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#servicios-desarrollados-por-lamassu","content":"El filtrado dentro del servicio evita fugas en listados: los recursos no autorizados quedan fuera de la consulta SQL en lugar de recuperarse y ocultarse después en la interfaz."},"497":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-66","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cómo-se-relacionan-ambos-caminos","content":"No son dos controles equivalentes aplicados dos veces. Las reglas HTTP protegen el perímetro de un servicio integrado; las reglas de entidad expresan permisos sobre el modelo de datos de los servicios nativos."},"498":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-67","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cómo-se-relacionan-ambos-caminos","content":"Una política puede contener ambos tipos de reglas cuando una identidad necesita operar recursos de Lamassu y también llamar a una API integrada. Conceder una regla de entidad no concede automáticamente una acción HTTP, ni una regla HTTP crea acceso sobre una entidad."},"499":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-68","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cómo-se-relacionan-ambos-caminos","content":"Si ninguna combinación de principal, política y regla permite la operación, Lamassu la deniega. Además, `auth.externalAuthorization.failOpen` vale `false` por defecto: si `authz` no está disponible, el Gateway bloquea las rutas protegidas."},"500":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-69","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-oidc","content":"Un principal OIDC coincide con los claims de un JWT validado. Es apropiado para usuarios humanos, grupos corporativos, roles del IdP y cuentas de servicio que obtienen tokens."},"501":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-70","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-oidc","content":"El siguiente principal representa a cualquier identidad que tenga el rol `pki-operators` en Keycloak:"},"502":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-71","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-oidc","content":"Las rutas de claims pueden estar anidadas, como `realm_access.roles`. Dentro de un mismo principal, **todas** las condiciones deben cumplirse. Esto permite exigir, por ejemplo, un grupo y una audiencia organizativa a la vez."},"503":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-72","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-oidc","content":"Los operadores implementados son:"},"504":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-73","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-oidc","content":"`equals`, para igualdad exacta;"},"505":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-74","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-oidc","content":"`contains`, para comprobar la pertenencia a una lista o la presencia de texto en un valor escalar."},"506":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-75","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-oidc","content":"Diseña la coincidencia con atributos estables. Para personas, suele ser mejor enlazar permisos a grupos o roles gestionados centralmente que al correo o al nombre de usuario. Para una cuenta de servicio, un `sub` estable evita que sus permisos se mezclen con los de un operador humano."},"507":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-76","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-oidc","content":"Aunque el modelo reconoce el nombre de operador `matches`, la implementación actual no evalúa expresiones regulares y la condición nunca coincide. Usa `equals` o `contains`."},"508":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-77","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-x509","content":"Un principal X.509 permite reconocer una carga de trabajo o un dispositivo mediante su certificado cliente. Lamassu comprueba la firma del certificado contra la CA configurada y, según el modo, también su número de serie o Common Name."},"509":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-78","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-x509","content":"Los modos disponibles son:"},"510":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-79","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-x509","content":"`serial_and_ca`: un certificado exacto, identificado por número de serie y CA;"},"511":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-80","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-x509","content":"`cn_and_ca`: un Common Name exacto o con comodines y una CA concreta;"},"512":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-81","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-x509","content":"`any_from_ca`: cualquier certificado emitido directamente por la CA indicada."},"513":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-82","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-x509","content":"Este ejemplo reconoce certificados cuyo CN comienza por `factory-a-` y que están firmados por la CA configurada:"},"514":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-83","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-x509","content":"`ca_trust.identity_type` acepta `fingerprint` o `authority_key_id`. En ambos casos debes aportar el certificado de la CA en `ca_trust.pem`; Lamassu verifica tanto la firma como la identidad esperada de la CA."},"515":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-84","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#principales-x509","content":"Usa `any_from_ca` únicamente cuando todas las identidades emitidas por esa CA deban compartir los mismos permisos. Si una CA emite certificados para poblaciones distintas, separa el acceso por serie o CN, o utiliza CAs de emisión diferentes."},"516":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-85","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cuando-coinciden-varios-principales","content":"Una misma credencial puede coincidir con más de un principal. Es habitual que un usuario coincida con un principal de su equipo y con otro de su función operativa."},"517":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-86","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cuando-coinciden-varios-principales","content":"Para permisos de entidad, Lamassu combina los permisos con lógica OR: basta con que una de las políticas de uno de los principales permita la acción. Los listados contienen la unión de los recursos visibles para todos ellos."},"518":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-87","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cuando-coinciden-varios-principales","content":"Las rutas HTTP con restricciones son más estrictas. El mismo principal que aporta la política debe satisfacer también los atributos exigidos por la ruta. Lamassu no combina la política de un principal con un atributo perteneciente a otro."},"519":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-88","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cuando-coinciden-varios-principales","content":"Por esta razón, añadir un principal coincidente solo puede ampliar el acceso. Antes de crear reglas solapadas, revisa el conjunto completo de políticas que recibirá una identidad real."},"520":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-89","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#acceso-global-y-acceso-directo","content":"Una regla identifica el dominio (`namespace`), el esquema de datos (`schema_name`) y el tipo de entidad (`entity_type`). `actions` enumera las operaciones permitidas."},"521":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-90","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#acceso-global-y-acceso-directo","content":"`direct_grants` limita la regla a identificadores concretos. El valor `*` abarca todas las instancias del tipo. Una política de superadministrador utiliza comodines en esquema, entidad, acciones y grants; una política de mínimo privilegio debe evitarlos siempre que sea posible."},"522":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-91","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#acceso-heredado-por-relaciones","content":"Las reglas pueden seguir relaciones declaradas entre entidades. Por ejemplo, el esquema conoce la relación de un certificado con su CA emisora y la de un dispositivo con su DMS. Una política puede conceder acceso a un recurso padre y propagar acciones seleccionadas hacia sus recursos relacionados."},"523":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-92","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#acceso-heredado-por-relaciones","content":"Esto permite expresar modelos como “puede operar los dispositivos de este DMS” sin mantener una lista individual de cada dispositivo. Cuando se añade un recurso bajo esa relación, hereda el alcance previsto por la política."},"524":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-93","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#acceso-filtrado-por-atributos","content":"`column_filters` aplica condiciones a columnas que el esquema haya declarado como filtrables. Todos los filtros de una misma regla se combinan con AND."},"525":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-94","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#acceso-filtrado-por-atributos","content":"Por ejemplo, esta regla permite leer certificados activos emitidos por una CA concreta:"},"526":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-95","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#acceso-filtrado-por-atributos","content":"Los operadores disponibles son `eq`, `neq`, `gt`, `gte`, `lt`, `lte`, `in` y `like`. Usa comparaciones coherentes con el tipo de columna: `like` para texto, comparaciones de orden para números o fechas y `in` cuando haya una colección de valores aceptados."},"527":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-96","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#reglas-http","content":"Las reglas HTTP no apuntan directamente a tablas. Referencian un esquema de rutas y conceden sus acciones lógicas. Las políticas del Job Manager son un ejemplo: distinguen lectura, creación, actualización y eliminación de workflows o jobs."},"528":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-97","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#reglas-http","content":"Algunas rutas también comparan un valor de la petición —extraído de la ruta, query, cabecera o cuerpo JSON— con un atributo normalizado del principal. Así puede verificarse que un dispositivo solo consulte trabajos dirigidos a su propio `client_id`."},"529":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-98","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#reglas-http","content":"Los atributos normalizados desacoplan la política del mecanismo de autenticación. `subject_attribute_mappings` puede derivar, por ejemplo, `device_id` desde `oidc.claim.device_id` o desde `x509.subject.cn`. La regla consume `device_id` en ambos casos."},"530":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-99","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#políticas-incluidas","content":"La precarga de `authz` instala políticas reutilizables para los dominios principales. Entre ellas se encuentran:"},"531":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-100","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#políticas-incluidas","content":"acceso completo y de solo lectura a certificados y autoridades;"},"532":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-101","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#políticas-incluidas","content":"acceso completo y de solo lectura a KMS;"},"533":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-102","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#políticas-incluidas","content":"acceso completo y de solo lectura a Device Manager, DMS Manager, Validation Authority y alertas;"},"534":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-103","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#políticas-incluidas","content":"una política `Auditor` de lectura de PKI y visibilidad de autorización;"},"535":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-104","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#políticas-incluidas","content":"acceso a la interfaz;"},"536":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-105","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#políticas-incluidas","content":"políticas de administración y observación para las APIs NBI y SBI del Job Manager;"},"537":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-106","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#políticas-incluidas","content":"`SUPER ADMIN`, que concede todas las acciones sobre los dominios `authz` y `pki`."},"538":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-107","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#políticas-incluidas","content":"Empieza por estas políticas antes de crear otras. Si ninguna refleja el límite que necesitas, crea una política específica y pequeña en lugar de copiar `SUPER ADMIN` y retirar permisos de forma informal."},"539":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-108","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Una instalación sin un principal que coincida con tu identidad queda sin nadie capaz de administrar la autorización. Configura el IdP y el bootstrap antes de exponer la plataforma."},"540":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-109","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El chart incluye un principal de bootstrap que busca el rol OIDC `pki-admin` en `realm_access.roles`. Le concede `SUPER ADMIN` y, cuando Job Manager está habilitado, la política administrativa de su API NBI."},"541":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-110","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El Job Helm de preinstalación y preactualización ejecuta las migraciones de `authz`, precarga las políticas y crea los principales de bootstrap antes de iniciar los servicios. Si el principal ya existe, no lo reemplaza: añade únicamente los grants configurados que todavía falten. Puedes conservar la entrada en `values.yaml` durante las actualizaciones."},"542":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-111","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#prepara-el-proveedor-de-identidad","content":"Crea el rol o grupo que utilizarás para recuperar y administrar Lamassu. Asígnalo al menos a dos identidades humanas controladas. Si tu proveedor no usa `realm_access.roles`, adapta la ruta del claim tanto en el frontend como en `auth_config.claims`."},"543":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-112","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#configura-las-dos-validaciones-jwt","content":"El Gateway utiliza `auth.authentication.apiGateway.jwks` para autenticar peticiones. `authz` utiliza `services.authz.jwkUrl` para resolver los principales OIDC. Ambos endpoints deben contener las claves del mismo emisor y ser alcanzables desde sus respectivos componentes."},"544":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-113","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#instala-y-verifica-el-acceso-administrativo","content":"Inicia sesión con una identidad que tenga `pki-admin`. Confirma que puede acceder a la administración de autorización y realizar una operación de lectura no destructiva."},"545":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-114","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#prueba-una-identidad-sin-privilegios","content":"Usa un segundo usuario sin el rol y confirma que la misma operación queda denegada. Esta prueba detecta claims mal interpretados, políticas demasiado amplias y configuraciones `failOpen` accidentales."},"546":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-115","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#reduce-el-uso-del-administrador-de-bootstrap","content":"Crea principales operativos con políticas de menor alcance. Reserva `pki-admin` para administración de autorización y recuperación, no para el trabajo diario."},"547":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-116","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#bootstrap-de-fastlane","content":"Fastlane instala un realm de Keycloak para laboratorio y crea el usuario `lamassu` con contraseña temporal `lamassu`, rol `pki-admin` y cambio de contraseña obligatorio. Su principal de bootstrap coincide mediante `preferred_username=lamassu`."},"548":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-117","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#bootstrap-de-fastlane","content":"Cambia la contraseña en el primer acceso. No reutilices el usuario, la contraseña ni el IdP de Fastlane como diseño de producción."},"549":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-118","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#diseña-roles-de-mínimo-privilegio","content":"Evita reproducir la estructura interna de tu empresa con decenas de políticas casi idénticas. Empieza por las responsabilidades que realmente necesitan acceso:"},"550":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-119","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#diseña-roles-de-mínimo-privilegio","content":"**Administración de autorización**: gestiona principales, políticas y grants. Debe pertenecer a un grupo pequeño y separado."},"551":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-120","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#diseña-roles-de-mínimo-privilegio","content":"**Operación de PKI**: administra CAs, perfiles y certificados, pero no necesariamente puede modificar quién obtiene acceso."},"552":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-121","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#diseña-roles-de-mínimo-privilegio","content":"**Registro de dispositivos**: opera dispositivos y DMS sin recibir permisos sobre claves o configuración de autorización."},"553":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-122","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#diseña-roles-de-mínimo-privilegio","content":"**Auditoría**: consulta configuración y actividad sin crear, modificar, firmar, revocar ni eliminar."},"554":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-123","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#diseña-roles-de-mínimo-privilegio","content":"**Automatización**: utiliza una cuenta técnica o certificado independiente, con permisos limitados al flujo y recursos que controla."},"555":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-124","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#diseña-roles-de-mínimo-privilegio","content":"Para cada rol, separa “ver” de “cambiar”, limita los recursos mediante grants, relaciones o atributos y evita `*` salvo que el rol deba abarcar futuras acciones automáticamente."},"556":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-125","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#diseña-roles-de-mínimo-privilegio","content":"Una regla con `actions: [\"*\"]` se expande a todas las acciones definidas por el esquema. Cuando una versión nueva añade una acción, una política con comodín puede empezar a concederla. Revisa estas políticas durante cada actualización."},"557":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-126","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cambios-y-revocación-de-acceso","content":"Para retirar acceso de inmediato, desactiva el principal o revoca sus grants. Desactivar un principal conserva su configuración y asociaciones para investigación o restauración, pero deja de participar en la coincidencia."},"558":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-127","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cambios-y-revocación-de-acceso","content":"Eliminar un rol o grupo en el IdP evita que nuevos tokens contengan el claim, pero un token ya emitido puede seguir siendo válido hasta expirar. Si la retirada es urgente, combina el cambio en el IdP con la desactivación del principal en Lamassu y la revocación de sesiones o tokens en el proveedor."},"559":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-128","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#cambios-y-revocación-de-acceso","content":"Cuando edites una política compartida, recuerda que el cambio afecta a todos sus principales. Para probar un nuevo alcance, crea una política separada, concédela a una identidad de prueba y valida operaciones permitidas y denegadas antes de sustituir la anterior."},"560":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-129","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#lista-de-comprobación-operativa","content":"Mantén `failOpen: false` salvo que una evaluación de riesgo documentada justifique lo contrario."},"561":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-130","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#lista-de-comprobación-operativa","content":"Usa grupos o roles estables para personas e identidades independientes para automatizaciones."},"562":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-131","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#lista-de-comprobación-operativa","content":"Conserva al menos dos administradores de recuperación y prueba su acceso periódicamente."},"563":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-132","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#lista-de-comprobación-operativa","content":"Revisa los principales activos, sus coincidencias y sus grants después de cambios en el IdP."},"564":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-133","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#lista-de-comprobación-operativa","content":"Busca comodines en políticas antes de actualizar Lamassu."},"565":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-134","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#lista-de-comprobación-operativa","content":"Prueba siempre una operación permitida y otra denegada para cada rol."},"566":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-135","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#lista-de-comprobación-operativa","content":"Correlaciona los cambios de principales, políticas y grants con los registros de auditoría."},"567":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-136","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-401","content":"La autenticación falló antes de evaluar permisos. Comprueba la firma y expiración del JWT, el emisor, la audiencia y la disponibilidad del JWKS configurado en el Gateway. Para X.509, revisa que el certificado cliente llegue hasta el punto que extrae la credencial."},"568":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-137","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-403","content":"La credencial pudo procesarse, pero no produjo una autorización positiva. Revisa en este orden:"},"569":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-138","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-403","content":"que exista un principal activo del tipo correcto;"},"570":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-139","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-403","content":"que las rutas de claims y sus valores coincidan exactamente con el token real;"},"571":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-140","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-403","content":"que todas las condiciones del principal se cumplan;"},"572":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-141","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-403","content":"que el principal tenga concedida la política esperada;"},"573":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-142","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-403","content":"que la política incluya la acción y el tipo de recurso o ruta solicitados;"},"574":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-143","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-403","content":"que el identificador, relación, filtro de columna o restricción HTTP incluya el recurso real."},"575":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-144","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#la-respuesta-es-403","content":"En los logs de `authz`, una decisión del endpoint externo incluye `allowed`, `reason`, `matched_principals`, `evaluated_policy_ids`, `matched_policy_id` y el código de estado. Estos campos permiten separar un fallo de coincidencia de un fallo de permisos."},"576":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-145","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#todo-devuelve-403","content":"Comprueba que el principal de bootstrap fue creado y que las políticas fueron precargadas por el Job de migración. Verifica también que `services.authz.jwkUrl` sea alcanzable desde el pod de `authz`; no asumas que una URL pública accesible desde el navegador también funciona dentro del clúster."},"577":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-146","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#todo-falla-cuando-authz-no-está-disponible","content":"Es el comportamiento esperado con `failOpen: false`. Restaura el servicio, su conexión con PostgreSQL y su conectividad con el JWKS. No cambies temporalmente a `failOpen: true` sin aceptar que las rutas protegidas podrían quedar accesibles sin decisión de autorización."},"578":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control-147","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/access-control#todo-falla-cuando-authz-no-está-disponible","content":"Continúa con Registros de auditoría para investigar cambios de configuración o con Resolución de problemas para diagnosticar el despliegue."},"579":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","type":"page","content":"Alertas y suscripciones","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administración"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts"},"580":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","content":"Envía eventos de la PKI a personas y sistemas externos."},"581":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Cómo funciona"},"582":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"Canales disponibles"},"583":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#crea-una-suscripción","content":"Crea una suscripción"},"584":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#elige-el-evento","content":"Elige el evento"},"585":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#configura-el-destino","content":"Configura el destino"},"586":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"Limita las notificaciones"},"587":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#revisa-y-activa","content":"Revisa y activa"},"588":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#gestiona-una-suscripción","content":"Gestiona una suscripción"},"589":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"Familias de eventos"},"590":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","content":"Las suscripciones convierten los eventos de Lamassu en notificaciones accionables. Puedes avisar a un equipo, alimentar un sistema de incidentes o activar una automatización cuando cambia una CA, un certificado o un dispositivo."},"591":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Un servicio publica un evento de dominio."},"592":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Lamassu evalúa las suscripciones asociadas a ese tipo de evento."},"593":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"El filtro de cada suscripción decide si debe notificarse."},"594":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Lamassu entrega el evento al canal configurado."},"595":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"El inventario de eventos muestra cuándo se observó cada tipo por última vez, cuántas veces ha ocurrido y cuántas suscripciones tiene. Puedes expandir un evento para inspeccionar un ejemplo de su payload JSON antes de crear el filtro."},"596":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"**Email** envía avisos a una persona o lista operativa. Solo requiere la dirección de destino."},"597":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"**Microsoft Teams** publica la notificación en un canal mediante su URL de webhook."},"598":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"**Webhook** entrega el evento a una automatización, SIEM o sistema de incidentes mediante `POST` o `PUT`."},"599":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#elige-el-evento","content":"Abre **Alerts**, localiza el tipo de evento y selecciona **Subscribe**. Revisa el último ejemplo JSON para identificar los campos que necesitarás filtrar."},"600":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#configura-el-destino","content":"Selecciona Email, Microsoft Teams o Webhook e introduce los datos del canal."},"601":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"Añade un filtro si no quieres recibir todas las instancias del evento."},"602":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**None** notifica todas las instancias del evento."},"603":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**JSON Path** evalúa uno o varios campos concretos."},"604":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**JSON Schema** acepta únicamente payloads con una estructura determinada."},"605":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**JavaScript** permite expresar lógica personalizada."},"606":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"Por ejemplo, `function (event) { return event.data.status == \"NO_IDENTITY\"; }` limita una suscripción a dispositivos sin identidad."},"607":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#revisa-y-activa","content":"Comprueba el evento, el canal y el filtro en el resumen. Selecciona **Confirm Subscription** para comenzar la entrega."},"608":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-28","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#gestiona-una-suscripción","content":"Abre una suscripción existente para consultar su destino y filtro, modificar la configuración o seleccionar **Unsubscribe**. Elimina las suscripciones que ya no tengan un propietario operativo para evitar entregas ignoradas o endpoints obsoletos."},"609":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-29","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Autoridades:** `ca.create`, `ca.import`, `ca.reissue` y `ca.delete`."},"610":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-30","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Certificados:** `ca.sign.certificate` y `certificate.delete`."},"611":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-31","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Perfiles:** `profile.create`, `profile.update` y `profile.delete`."},"612":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-32","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Enrolamiento:** `dms.create`, `dms.update`, `dms.enroll` y `dms.reenroll`."},"613":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-33","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Dispositivos:** `device.create`, `device.identity.update` y `device.status.update`."},"614":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-34","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Validación:** `va.role.crl.create`."},"615":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-35","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Claves:** `kms.create`, `kms.import`, `kms.sign.message` y `kms.delete`."},"616":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts-36","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"Utiliza el catálogo que muestra la consola como fuente para los tipos disponibles en la versión que tienes desplegada."},"617":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"page","content":"Registros de auditoría","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administración"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs"},"618":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","content":"Entiende qué eventos de auditoría genera Lamassu y cómo convertirlos en una pista durable."},"619":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#qué-contiene-un-evento","content":"Qué contiene un evento"},"620":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"Cobertura"},"621":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"Publicación y persistencia"},"622":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#datos-sensibles","content":"Datos sensibles"},"623":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#una-investigación-reproducible","content":"Una investigación reproducible"},"624":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#acota-el-intervalo","content":"Acota el intervalo"},"625":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#identifica-la-operación","content":"Identifica la operación"},"626":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#atribuye-el-principal","content":"Atribuye el principal"},"627":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#compara-intención-y-resultado","content":"Compara intención y resultado"},"628":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#sigue-el-efecto","content":"Sigue el efecto"},"629":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"Verificación periódica"},"630":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","content":"Lamassu instrumenta las operaciones mutables de sus servicios con eventos de auditoría. Cada evento describe la operación, los principales que coincidieron, la entrada, el resultado y si terminó con error."},"631":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#qué-contiene-un-evento","content":"El cuerpo de auditoría incluye:"},"632":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#qué-contiene-un-evento","content":"input: datos recibidos por la operación;"},"633":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#qué-contiene-un-evento","content":"has\\_error: indica si el servicio devolvió un error;"},"634":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#qué-contiene-un-evento","content":"output: resultado producido o mensaje de error;"},"635":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#qué-contiene-un-evento","content":"principals: identificadores de los principales que coincidieron con la petición."},"636":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#qué-contiene-un-evento","content":"Las operaciones correctas usan un tipo con prefijo audit.. Los fallos publican el tipo de operación con sufijo .error. El evento CloudEvents añade, además, fuente, identificador, fecha y tipo."},"637":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#qué-contiene-un-evento","content":"Los middlewares publican el registro después de ejecutar la operación, tanto si tuvo éxito como si devolvió un error. Esto permite investigar intentos además de cambios confirmados."},"638":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"El backend aplica auditoría a mutaciones de:"},"639":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"autoridades, certificados y perfiles de emisión;"},"640":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"claves y motores KMS;"},"641":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"dispositivos e identidades;"},"642":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"DMS y operaciones de enrolamiento;"},"643":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"funciones de validación y CRL;"},"644":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"principales, políticas y concesiones de autorización."},"645":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"No confundas estos eventos con los eventos de dominio. Un evento de dominio comunica que un recurso cambió para que otro componente reaccione; el evento de auditoría conserva contexto de entrada, salida y principal para investigación."},"646":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-28","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"Los servicios publican auditoría en el bus de eventos cuando su PublisherEventBus está habilitado. El código del backend no implementa un archivo de auditoría consultable y durable por sí solo."},"647":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-29","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"Si necesitas retención, búsquedas, protección contra alteraciones o exportación regulatoria, conecta un consumidor que persista los eventos en el sistema aprobado por tu organización."},"648":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-30","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"Diseña el consumidor para:"},"649":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-31","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"suscribirse a los tipos audit.# y también a los tipos de operación terminados en .error;"},"650":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-32","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"conservar el CloudEvent completo sin modificar;"},"651":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-33","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"registrar el momento de ingestión y detectar duplicados por ID;"},"652":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-34","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"cifrar en tránsito y en reposo;"},"653":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-35","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"limitar lectura y borrado a un rol separado del operador de PKI;"},"654":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-36","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"aplicar una política explícita de retención y legal hold;"},"655":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-37","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#publicación-y-persistencia","content":"alertar si deja de consumir o aumenta la cola pendiente."},"656":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-38","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#datos-sensibles","content":"Los campos input y output pueden contener sujetos, metadatos, material público, configuración o mensajes de error. Evalúa su clasificación antes de enviarlos a una plataforma externa."},"657":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-39","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#datos-sensibles","content":"No registres claves privadas, secretos de proveedores ni tokens completos en automatizaciones que rodean a Lamassu. Restringe la exportación y aplica redacción en el destino sin destruir los campos necesarios para atribución."},"658":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-40","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#acota-el-intervalo","content":"Parte de la hora reportada y normaliza todas las fuentes a UTC."},"659":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-41","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#identifica-la-operación","content":"Filtra por tipo de evento, fuente de servicio e identificador del recurso."},"660":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-42","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#atribuye-el-principal","content":"Revisa principals y correlaciónalo con el proveedor OIDC o la identidad X.509 vigente en ese momento."},"661":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-43","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#compara-intención-y-resultado","content":"Contrasta input, has\\_error y output. Un intento fallido no implica que el recurso haya cambiado."},"662":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-44","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#sigue-el-efecto","content":"Busca los eventos de dominio y registros del servicio que compartan recurso y ventana temporal. En una revocación de CA, incluye las operaciones en cascada."},"663":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-45","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"Genera una mutación controlada en un entorno de prueba y comprueba que:"},"664":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-46","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"aparece un evento de auditoría correcto;"},"665":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-47","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"el principal coincide con la identidad utilizada;"},"666":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-48","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"el consumidor lo persiste una sola vez;"},"667":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-49","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"puede recuperarse por recurso, actor y periodo;"},"668":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-50","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"una interrupción del consumidor produce una alerta."},"669":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-51","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"Para métricas, trazas y logs técnicos del despliegue, consulta Resolución de problemas. La auditoría responde a “quién intentó cambiar qué”; la observabilidad explica cómo se comportó el sistema."},"670":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"page","content":"Arquitectura de la plataforma","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture"},"671":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","content":"Componentes de Lamassu y relación entre control, claves, emisión y dispositivos."},"672":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture#plano-de-control","content":"Plano de control"},"673":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture#custodia-y-operaciones-criptográficas","content":"Custodia y operaciones criptográficas"},"674":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture#emisión-y-enrolamiento","content":"Emisión y enrolamiento"},"675":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture#estado-y-validación","content":"Estado y validación"},"676":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture#dependencias-de-la-plataforma","content":"Dependencias de la plataforma"},"677":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","content":"Lamassu se despliega como un conjunto de servicios independientes. La separación evita que todos los componentes necesiten acceso directo a las claves privadas y permite escalar cada capacidad según la carga."},"678":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","content":"Cambia al nivel bajo para ver el interior de la caja de la plataforma Lamassu (CA, KMS, DMS, Device Manager, VA, Alerts, el conector de AWS IoT, Job Manager y la consola/API), y al nivel medio para verla como una única plataforma junto a sus dependencias externas."},"679":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture#plano-de-control","content":"La consola y las APIs administran autoridades, certificados, DMS, dispositivos, alertas y configuración. Los eventos de dominio permiten que conectores y automatizaciones reaccionen a los cambios sin sondear continuamente la plataforma."},"680":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture#custodia-y-operaciones-criptográficas","content":"El KMS ofrece una interfaz común sobre motores software, PKCS#11 y proveedores cloud. El motor seleccionado conserva la clave o delega la operación criptográfica sin que los demás servicios conozcan su implementación."},"681":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture#emisión-y-enrolamiento","content":"El servicio de CA emite certificados y mantiene la relación con su autoridad. El DMS aplica las reglas de enrolamiento y expone los flujos EST para que un dispositivo solicite o renueve una identidad."},"682":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture#estado-y-validación","content":"Device Manager conserva la vista operativa del dispositivo y su historial. Validation Authority publica OCSP y CRLs para que otros sistemas decidan si deben confiar en un certificado presentado."},"683":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/architecture#dependencias-de-la-plataforma","content":"En un despliegue autogestionado, Lamassu utiliza PostgreSQL para persistencia, RabbitMQ para mensajería y un proveedor OIDC para autenticación. Consulta la arquitectura de despliegue para ver cómo se publican los servicios en Kubernetes."},"684":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","type":"page","content":"Cómo funciona Lamassu","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview"},"685":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","content":"El modelo mental de confianza, claves, certificados y dispositivos."},"686":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"El modelo en cinco piezas"},"687":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Del alta a la operación"},"688":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","content":"Lamassu conecta tres elementos: una **raíz de confianza**, una **política de emisión** y una **entidad que necesita demostrar su identidad**. La plataforma coordina esos elementos durante todo el ciclo de vida del certificado."},"689":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Motor criptográfico.** Genera o custodia claves y ejecuta las operaciones privadas sin exponer el material criptográfico al resto de servicios."},"690":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Autoridad de certificación (CA).** Firma certificados y establece la cadena de confianza."},"691":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Device Management Service (DMS).** Define cómo se registran, autentican y renuevan los dispositivos de una flota."},"692":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Dispositivo.** Conserva su clave privada y presenta el certificado para demostrar su identidad."},"693":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Validation Authority (VA).** Publica el estado de los certificados mediante OCSP y CRL."},"694":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Un administrador configura un motor criptográfico y crea o importa una CA."},"695":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Un DMS relaciona esa CA con una política de enrolamiento."},"696":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"El dispositivo genera una clave y solicita un certificado mediante EST, o un operador le asigna una identidad."},"697":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Lamassu conserva el inventario, el historial y el estado de la identidad."},"698":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Los consumidores comprueban la cadena y consultan OCSP o una CRL cuando necesitan conocer su vigencia."},"699":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"<Card title=\"Arquitectura\" description=\"Conoce los componentes y dónde termina la responsabilidad de cada uno.\" href=\"/docs/platform/concepts/architecture\" />"},"700":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"<Card title=\"Ciclo de vida de una identidad\" description=\"Sigue un certificado desde el enrolamiento hasta la renovación o revocación.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle\" />"},"701":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"page","content":"Dispositivos e identidades","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management"},"702":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","content":"Registra, inspecciona y retira dispositivos comprobando su identidad actual y su historial."},"703":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Estados del dispositivo"},"704":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"Inspecciona un dispositivo"},"705":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#registra-un-dispositivo-manualmente","content":"Registra un dispositivo manualmente"},"706":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#crea-el-dispositivo","content":"Crea el dispositivo"},"707":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#define-su-pertenencia","content":"Define su pertenencia"},"708":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#clasifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Clasifica el dispositivo"},"709":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#verifica-el-alta","content":"Verifica el alta"},"710":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Asigna una identidad manualmente"},"711":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#revoca-la-identidad-actual","content":"Revoca la identidad actual"},"712":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"Retira un dispositivo"},"713":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#automatiza-el-enrolamiento","content":"Automatiza el enrolamiento"},"714":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","content":"Esta guía se dirige al operador de una flota. Necesitas permisos sobre dispositivos, DMS y certificados para las acciones que vayas a realizar. Una flota se organiza mediante esos recursos, etiquetas y metadatos; no se crea un objeto independiente de «flota»."},"715":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","content":"Cada dispositivo tiene un `Device ID`, un DMS propietario (`dms_owner`) y, cuando está aprovisionado, un slot de identidad con una versión activa y versiones anteriores. En los flujos descritos, mantén el `Common Name` de la CSR y del certificado igual al `Device ID`: la vinculación utiliza ese CN para actualizar el dispositivo."},"716":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Vista operativa"},"717":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Interpretación"},"718":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**No Identity**"},"719":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Hay registro, pero todavía no hay identidad asociada."},"720":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Active**"},"721":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"El slot está activo; comprueba además las fechas, estado y usos del certificado."},"722":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Renewal Pending**"},"723":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"La identidad está en la ventana operativa de renovación."},"724":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Expiring Soon**"},"725":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Se aproxima al vencimiento según los umbrales configurados."},"726":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Expired**"},"727":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"La identidad ha vencido."},"728":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Revoked**"},"729":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"La identidad está marcada como revocada."},"730":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-28","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Decommissioned**"},"731":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-29","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"El registro está retirado y no vuelve al estado operativo mediante una actualización normal."},"732":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-30","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Los estados de dispositivo, slot y certificado son distintos. Los eventos y trabajos pueden actualizar la vista después de guardar el certificado; una etiqueta **Active** no prueba aceptación por un consumidor."},"733":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-31","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"Filtra el inventario por ID, etiquetas y estado. Abre el detalle y registra DMS propietario, versión activa y serie del certificado actual."},"734":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-32","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"**Certificate History** relaciona versiones anteriores y actuales. Sustituir el slot no revoca por sí solo todas las versiones anteriores."},"735":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-33","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"**Device Event Timeline** ayuda a reconstruir altas, aprovisionamientos, renovaciones y cambios de estado. Un cambio puede haberse guardado aunque falle la persistencia de su evento; contrasta también el registro y los certificados."},"736":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-34","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"Compara esos datos con la identidad instalada en el dispositivo. Un slot actualizado en Lamassu no instala archivos en el equipo remoto."},"737":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-35","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#registra-un-dispositivo-manualmente","content":"Utiliza este flujo para preparar inventario o asignar una identidad desde la consola. Necesitas un DMS existente."},"738":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-36","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#crea-el-dispositivo","content":"Desde **Managed Devices**, abre el registro. Confirma que el ID no exista en otro DMS: la búsqueda por ID no está limitada a una flota."},"739":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-37","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#define-su-pertenencia","content":"Introduce el **Device ID** y selecciona el DMS que será su propietario. La etiqueta **Registration Authority** de la consola se refiere a ese DMS."},"740":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-38","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#clasifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Añade icono y etiquetas de modelo, entorno o ubicación según tu inventario."},"741":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-39","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#verifica-el-alta","content":"Vuelve a leer el dispositivo: debe tener el DMS previsto y estar en **No Identity**. Sigue Registro manual para completar la asignación."},"742":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-40","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#verifica-el-alta","content":"Prerregistrar no demuestra que `/simpleenroll` vaya a admitir la solicitud. Revisa la interacción con `enable_replaceable_enrollment` en Estrategias de aprovisionamiento."},"743":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-41","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Desde **No Identity**, utiliza **Assign Identity**:"},"744":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-42","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Elige un certificado activo, vigente y adecuado para el consumidor, con `CN` exactamente igual al `Device ID`."},"745":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-43","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Si no existe, **Issue New Instead** permite iniciar una emisión con la CA prevista. Revisa primero el perfil."},"746":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-44","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Confirma y vuelve a consultar serie, versión activa e historial."},"747":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-45","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Instala la pareja clave/certificado y las intermedias necesarias en el dispositivo, y prueba su uso."},"748":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-46","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Emitir, vincular e instalar son pasos distintos. Si falla la operación, comprueba cuáles se guardaron antes de repetirla."},"749":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-47","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#revoca-la-identidad-actual","content":"Localiza la serie activa en el historial y revócala con una razón apropiada. Comprueba registro, publicación OCSP/CRL y rechazo de una conexión nueva en el consumidor con la guía de certificados."},"750":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-48","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#revoca-la-identidad-actual","content":"La revocación no elimina el dispositivo. Tampoco habilita automáticamente una nueva inscripción: la recuperación depende de su credencial, estado y política DMS. `CertificateHold` puede reactivarse bajo las condiciones de PKI; otras razones bloquean cambios posteriores del certificado."},"751":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-49","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"Antes de **Decommission**, inventaría identidades activas y anteriores, conexiones y permisos del destino. Prepara su retirada en el consumidor."},"752":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-50","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"El backend guarda **Decommissioned** e intenta revocar el certificado de la versión activa con `CessationOfOperation` si el slot no estaba expirado o revocado. No recorre todo el historial. La revocación diferida puede fallar después de guardar la baja; verifica su resultado por serie."},"753":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-51","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"El estado retirado protege las actualizaciones normales del dispositivo y su slot. No constituye una garantía de que toda solicitud EST sea rechazada antes de emitir: la vinculación puede omitir un dispositivo retirado sin devolver error. Confirma que no quedan certificados o permisos utilizables y bloquea nuevas admisiones en el control correspondiente."},"754":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-52","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"Conserva los registros según tu política de auditoría. No reutilices un ID retirado para ocultar el cambio de equipo."},"755":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-53","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#automatiza-el-enrolamiento","content":"<Card title=\"Enrola y conecta un dispositivo\" description=\"Obtén una identidad desde el cliente y prueba mTLS.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device\" />"},"756":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-54","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#automatiza-el-enrolamiento","content":"<Card title=\"Renovación y recuperación\" description=\"Instala el sucesor y trata fallos sin perder el estado conocido.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery\" />"},"757":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"page","content":"Identidad inicial y autenticación","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity"},"758":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","content":"Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll."},"759":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#confianza-inicial-del-servidor","content":"Confianza inicial del servidor"},"760":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#credencial-bootstrap","content":"Credencial bootstrap"},"761":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#modos-por-operación","content":"Modos por operación"},"762":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"Contrato del webhook"},"763":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#revocación-y-comprobaciones","content":"Revocación y comprobaciones"},"764":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","content":"Esta guía conecta al administrador DMS con quien fabrica o integra el dispositivo. Antes de solicitar su identidad operativa, el cliente debe poder autenticar al servidor EST y demostrar que tiene derecho a solicitar el ID previsto."},"765":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#confianza-inicial-del-servidor","content":"Instala una raíz, cadena o pin previamente verificado mediante un canal confiable: fabricación, configuración aprobada o distribución autenticada. Ese material permite verificar TLS y el nombre del servidor antes de descargar `/cacerts`."},"766":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#confianza-inicial-del-servidor","content":"No puedes obtener tu única prueba de confianza del mismo servidor todavía no autenticado. El certificado TLS del servidor EST, el certificado bootstrap y la CA emisora de la identidad operativa pueden pertenecer a jerarquías distintas."},"767":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#credencial-bootstrap","content":"Con `CLIENT_CERTIFICATE`, el dispositivo presenta su certificado inicial y demuestra posesión de su clave en TLS. El DMS lo valida frente a sus CAs de admisión. En el flujo examinado, el validador recibe una credencial de hoja: configura y prueba el emisor directo para el caso sencillo; enviar más intermedias desde el cliente no demuestra que lleguen al servicio."},"768":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#credencial-bootstrap","content":"Comprueba fechas, certificado y clave correspondientes y estado de revocación antes de provisionarlos. Una credencial compartida entre equipos identifica esa credencial compartida, no a un equipo concreto."},"769":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#credencial-bootstrap","content":"En el primer enrolamiento, la validación mTLS no compara por sí sola el CN del bootstrap con el CN solicitado en la CSR. Si necesitas que un solicitante solo pueda pedir su propio `Device ID`, añade un control que vincule credencial e ID, por ejemplo el webhook combinado, y prueba una solicitud con otro CN. En reenrolamiento con certificado sí se compara su CN con el de la CSR; las comprobaciones posteriores utilizan la identidad activa registrada."},"770":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#modos-por-operación","content":"Los cuatro modos se seleccionan independientemente para enrolamiento y reenrolamiento en DMS. La credencial utilizada al renovar depende de ese bloque; no presupongas que siempre será el bootstrap o que el webhook desaparezca."},"771":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#modos-por-operación","content":"Un token OIDC de administración no es un modo EST nativo. Un webhook puede interpretar una cabecera de credencial que acuerdes con él; en ese caso la autorización la realiza ese servicio. En NO\\_AUTH, enviar un token no añade autenticación al DMS."},"772":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"El DMS envía el contexto de la operación al servicio configurado. El método procede de la configuración; acuerda su contrato antes de seleccionar POST o PUT. La espera de autorización tiene un valor inicial de 10 segundos, sustituido por un timeout positivo configurado."},"773":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"Ejemplo de cuerpo:"},"774":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"`csr` contiene **base64 del PEM**, a diferencia del cuerpo EST, que contiene base64 del DER. `http_request` recoge URL y primeras entradas de cabeceras del contexto HTTP disponible. El campo `operation` no se envía en este cuerpo; distingue enroll y reenroll mediante la ruta y la política configurada."},"775":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"El webhook debe verificar la credencial, su relación con `device_cn`, DMS, operación y política de admisión. Las cabeceras transportadas no son por sí mismas evidencia de confianza. La autenticación de **Lamassu hacia el webhook** es otra relación distinta que se configura en el cliente HTTP del servidor."},"776":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"La continuación requiere respuesta HTTP satisfactoria y JSON:"},"777":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"Un `204` sin cuerpo no cumple el contrato. Rechazo, error de transporte, respuesta no interpretable o timeout abortan la autorización. En modo combinado, primero se valida el certificado y después se consulta el webhook. Consulta la especificación del webhook."},"778":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#revocación-y-comprobaciones","content":"El DMS busca primero el certificado en Lamassu; para uno externo intenta OCSP y CRL. Si no logra comprobar revocación, los validadores pueden continuar tratándolo como no revocado. El código tampoco permite asumir que todo estado externo distinto de Good se rechace. Verifica el comportamiento requerido con tu credencial y endpoint reales; no presentes esta comprobación como una política estricta garantizada para todas las fuentes."},"779":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#revocación-y-comprobaciones","content":"Prueba certificado permitido, certificado incorrecto, CN ajeno, webhook denegado, timeout y reenrolamiento bajo su propia política. Conserva el resultado y programa la retirada de las credenciales bootstrap cuando corresponda. Continúa con Cliente EST."},"780":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"page","content":"Configura y opera el DMS","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms"},"781":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","content":"Define registro, autenticación por operación, emisión, renovación y confianza distribuida."},"782":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"783":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configura-un-dms","content":"Configura un DMS"},"784":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#identifica-la-flota","content":"Identifica la flota"},"785":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#selecciona-la-ca-de-enrolamiento","content":"Selecciona la CA de enrolamiento"},"786":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configura-est","content":"Configura EST"},"787":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribuye-la-confianza","content":"Distribuye la confianza"},"788":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#verifica-los-endpoints","content":"Verifica los endpoints"},"789":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-enrollment","content":"Configuración de enrollment"},"790":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"Enrollment Device Registration"},"791":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Enrollment Settings"},"792":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Autenticación por operación"},"793":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#perfil-de-emisión","content":"Perfil de emisión"},"794":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Configuración de re-enrollment"},"795":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#serverkeygen","content":"ServerKeyGen"},"796":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Distribución de confianza"},"797":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"Opera el inventario de DMS"},"798":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#integra-los-dispositivos","content":"Integra los dispositivos"},"799":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","content":"Un &#x2A;*Device Management Service (DMS)** configura la admisión y el ciclo de identidad de sus dispositivos. Actúa como autoridad de registro; la CA indicada en `Enrollment CA` firma los certificados. Esta guía se dirige a quien administra esa política."},"800":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#antes-de-empezar","content":"Necesitas permisos para gestionar DMS, una CA activa con clave utilizable y un perfil de emisión probado. Acuerda con el integrador ID del dispositivo, credencial inicial, consumidor y ventana de renovación. Revisa la estrategia de aprovisionamiento antes de elegir registro y sustitución."},"801":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#antes-de-empezar","content":"Prepara confianza del servidor EST y acceso desde el dispositivo con Despliegue. La autenticación administrativa de tu operador no sustituye la autenticación EST del dispositivo."},"802":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#identifica-la-flota","content":"Crea el DMS con un nombre reconocible y conserva su ID. Las URLs EST utilizan ese identificador, no el nombre visible. Cada dispositivo conserva un DMS propietario."},"803":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#selecciona-la-ca-de-enrolamiento","content":"Elige **Enrollment CA** y un perfil explícito apropiado para la identidad final. Mantén CN compatible con `Device ID`. El certificado de prueba debe permitir el uso previsto y terminar dentro de la vigencia del emisor."},"804":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configura-est","content":"Selecciona registro y autenticación del primer enrolamiento. Configura por separado la autenticación de reenrolamiento, sus umbrales y la retirada del certificado anterior. Deja ServerKeyGen deshabilitado si el cliente genera su clave."},"805":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribuye-la-confianza","content":"Selecciona los certificados que devolverá `/cacerts`. Incluye explícitamente las intermedias y raíces necesarias, sin confundir distribución con instalación automática de confianza."},"806":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#verifica-los-endpoints","content":"Guarda y vuelve a leer la configuración. Consulta `/cacerts`, realiza un enrolamiento permitido y otro rechazado, y comprueba dispositivo, serie e historial. Crear el DMS o descargar cacerts no demuestra que autenticación y emisión funcionen."},"807":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"`settings.enrollment_settings.registration_mode` permite `JITP` o `PRE_REGISTRATION`. En JITP se crea el dispositivo desconocido con el CN de la CSR como ID y el DMS como propietario. El `device_provisioning_profile` aporta etiquetas, metadatos e icono a ese alta."},"808":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"En PRE\\_REGISTRATION, el ID debe existir previamente. En el código examinado, un dispositivo existente pasa antes por el control de sustitución, incluso si no tiene identidad. Consulta las condiciones de prerregistro antes de utilizar este modo."},"809":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-28","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Campo de `settings.enrollment_settings`"},"810":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-29","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Decisión"},"811":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-30","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`protocol`"},"812":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-31","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`EST_RFC7030` para estas operaciones."},"813":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-32","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`enrollment_ca`"},"814":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-33","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"ID de la CA que firmará."},"815":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-34","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`verify_csr_signature`"},"816":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-35","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Mantén `true` para comprobar posesión de la clave de la CSR."},"817":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-36","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`enable_replaceable_enrollment`"},"818":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-37","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Permite `/simpleenroll` para un ID existente del mismo DMS. Puede intentar revocar el anterior incluso si falla una fase posterior; no es un cambio atómico."},"819":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-38","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`est_rfc7030_settings.auth_mode`"},"820":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-39","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Uno de los cuatro modos de autenticación."},"821":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-40","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Si el ID pertenece a otro DMS, el enrolamiento inicial se rechaza. No actives sustitución como respuesta automática a un error; el diagnóstico distingue ID repetido, propiedad y cambios parciales."},"822":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-41","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Los bloques son independientes:"},"823":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-42","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`settings.enrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings` para `/simpleenroll` y `/serverkeygen`."},"824":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-43","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`settings.reenrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings` para `/simplereenroll`."},"825":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-44","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`auth_mode`"},"826":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-45","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Control aplicado en la operación configurada"},"827":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-46","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`CLIENT_CERTIFICATE`"},"828":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-47","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Validación del certificado presentado."},"829":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-48","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`EXTERNAL_WEBHOOK`"},"830":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-49","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Autorización del webhook configurado."},"831":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-50","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`CLIENT_CERTIFICATE_AND_EXTERNAL_WEBHOOK`"},"832":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-51","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Validación del certificado y, después, aprobación del webhook."},"833":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-52","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`NO_AUTH`"},"834":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-53","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Sin autenticación del solicitante por el DMS."},"835":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-54","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Webhook y modo combinado también se ejecutan en reenrolamiento si se configuran en su bloque. No hay una degradación implícita a NO\\_AUTH en esos casos. Un modo ausente o no reconocido falla."},"836":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-55","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Para mTLS inicial, `client_certificate_settings` contiene `validation_cas`, `allow_expired` y `chain_level_validation`. El flujo examinado recibe una credencial de certificado, no garantiza transportar todas las intermedias del handshake al validador. Para el caso directo, configura como CA de validación el emisor directo del bootstrap y prueba la ruta real del Gateway."},"837":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-56","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"En reenrolamiento con certificado, el validador utiliza la CA de enrolamiento, después `additional_validation_cas`, y la opción `enable_expired_renewal`. No presupongas que copiar `validation_cas` del bloque inicial cambia esos emisores."},"838":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-57","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Para el webhook, configura destino, autenticación de Lamassu hacia ese servicio, método y timeout. El contrato de autenticación explica la credencial del dispositivo y el cuerpo de la llamada. `NO_AUTH` no acredita propiedad del ID solicitado."},"839":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-58","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"La migración `20260604110000` copia la autenticación inicial al bloque de renovación si este falta y existe la estructura necesaria. No sustituye una configuración ya presente. Después de actualizar, lee ambos bloques; si la consola de tu versión no expone la configuración independiente, utiliza la API DMS."},"840":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-59","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#perfil-de-emisión","content":"`settings.issuance_profile_id` tiene precedencia sobre `settings.issuance_profile`; si ninguno existe, se utiliza el perfil predeterminado de la CA. Las reglas se documentan una sola vez en Perfiles. Cambiar un DMS afecta a solicitudes futuras; no modifica certificados ya firmados ni instala confianza en clientes."},"841":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-60","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Campo de `settings.reenrollment_settings`"},"842":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-61","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Función"},"843":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-62","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`reenrollment_delta`"},"844":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-63","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"La ventana abre en `NotAfter` del certificado activo menos este delta."},"845":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-64","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`preventive_delta`"},"846":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-65","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Umbral operativo preventivo de monitorización."},"847":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-66","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`critical_delta`"},"848":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-67","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Umbral operativo crítico de monitorización."},"849":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-68","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`enable_expired_renewal`"},"850":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-69","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Aceptación de un certificado presentado vencido en el validador mTLS de renovación. No autoriza por sí solo otro modo ni elimina restricciones del Gateway."},"851":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-70","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`additional_validation_cas`"},"852":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-71","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Emisores adicionales para la credencial mTLS durante una migración."},"853":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-72","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`revoke_on_reenrollment`"},"854":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-73","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Si el certificado anterior está ACTIVE, intenta revocarlo con Superseded antes de vincular el sucesor."},"855":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-74","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Monitorizar no renueva: el cliente debe programar la solicitud y la instalación. En modos webhook o NO\\_AUTH, la política de credencial vencida no pasa por el mismo validador mTLS; el webhook debe autorizar explícitamente la recuperación que admita. Revisa Renovación y recuperación para orden de operaciones y fallos parciales."},"856":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-75","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#serverkeygen","content":"`settings.server_keygen_settings.enabled` habilita generación software en el servidor. Algoritmo y tamaño proceden de su campo `key`; el perfil de emisión debe permitirlos. La respuesta contiene una clave PKCS#8 sin cifrar dentro de TLS, además del certificado. Consulta formato y extracción en Referencia EST."},"857":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-76","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Opción"},"858":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-77","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Qué publica"},"859":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-78","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"**Include Lamassu System CA**"},"860":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-79","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Certificado TLS downstream disponible; puede ser una hoja, no una CA de emisión."},"861":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-80","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"**Include Enrollment CA**"},"862":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-81","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Certificado de la CA emisora seleccionada."},"863":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-82","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"**Managed CAs**"},"864":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-83","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Certificados de las CAs elegidas explícitamente."},"865":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-84","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"No se añaden todos los ascendientes automáticamente. La distribución de confianza distingue raíces confiables, intermedias y confianza inicial del servidor."},"866":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-85","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"**Edit** cambia nombre, ajustes y metadatos. La actualización del backend sustituye esos bloques completos; al usar la API, lee el DMS antes de enviar una edición para no perder campos."},"867":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-86","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"**Go to DMS owned devices** limita el inventario al propietario. **Show/Edit Metadata** contiene datos operativos y de integraciones; consulta su guía antes de alterarlos. &#x2A;*EST (RFC-7030)** ayuda a localizar las URLs."},"868":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-87","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"**Delete** elimina el registro y la configuración del DMS; no realiza por sí solo una cascada de revocación sobre todos sus dispositivos y certificados. Migra dependencias y conserva las referencias de auditoría antes de retirarlo."},"869":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-88","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#integra-los-dispositivos","content":"Continúa con Cliente EST o el tutorial de enrolamiento y mTLS. La Referencia EST recoge formatos; Diagnóstico recoge fallos."},"870":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"page","content":"Integra el cliente EST","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client"},"871":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","content":"Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida."},"872":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"873":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#descarga-e-inspecciona-cacerts","content":"Descarga e inspecciona cacerts"},"874":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#prepara-la-csr","content":"Prepara la CSR"},"875":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#solicita-la-identidad","content":"Solicita la identidad"},"876":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#comprueba-e-instala-el-resultado","content":"Comprueba e instala el resultado"},"877":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#siguientes-pasos","content":"Siguientes pasos"},"878":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","content":"Esta guía es para quien implementa el cliente del dispositivo. El administrador debe haber preparado la política DMS. Para una primera ejecución completa, sigue Enrola y conecta tu primer dispositivo."},"879":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#antes-de-empezar","content":"Necesitas el URL HTTPS público del DMS, la confianza del servidor obtenida por un canal aprobado, el modo de autenticación de la operación y un identificador admitido. Los ejemplos usan Bash, OpenSSL 3.x y curl con `--fail-with-body`; utiliza un directorio privado de trabajo y una versión compatible de esas herramientas."},"880":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#antes-de-empezar","content":"Prepara `est-trust.pem` para verificar al servidor EST, `bootstrap.crt` y `bootstrap.key` para la autenticación inicial por certificado, y `device-root.pem` como raíz aprobada del emisor de dispositivos. Los dos archivos de confianza pueden contener raíces distintas. Si usas otra autenticación, adapta las credenciales según Identidad inicial."},"881":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#antes-de-empezar","content":"Sustituye el host y `REPLACE_DMS_ID` por los de tu instalación. El APS del URL es el identificador del DMS, no su nombre visible."},"882":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#descarga-e-inspecciona-cacerts","content":"El contenido predeterminado es PKCS#7 DER codificado en Base64. No es un archivo PEM directo."},"883":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#descarga-e-inspecciona-cacerts","content":"Comprueba las huellas, emisores y fechas frente a la política de distribución de confianza. La respuesta puede contener una selección de CAs y el certificado TLS de Lamassu. No conviertas todo el contenido en raíces confiables ni lo utilices para autenticar la misma descarga inicial. Un HTTP 200 aquí no demuestra que la autenticación ni la emisión funcionen."},"884":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#prepara-la-csr","content":"El ejemplo genera una clave EC P-256 nueva y usa `est-device-001`, que debe estar libre si el DMS registra automáticamente. El `Common Name` será el identificador del dispositivo. Comprueba que el perfil permite la clave y el sujeto elegidos."},"885":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#prepara-la-csr","content":"Una implementación con hardware o almacén propio debe producir la CSR mediante su clave residente. `simpleenroll` envía la solicitud y conserva la clave en el cliente. Honor Extensions no autoriza todos los atributos pedidos: consulta Perfiles."},"886":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#solicita-la-identidad","content":"Con autenticación inicial `CLIENT_CERTIFICATE`, envía la CSR DER en Base64 con `Content-Type: application/pkcs10`:"},"887":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#solicita-la-identidad","content":"Detén el proceso si curl falla. Conserva el código HTTP, cabeceras y cuerpo para el diagnóstico; una respuesta de error no se decodifica como certificado. El ejemplo Bash se detiene antes de esa conversión. Un timeout deja el resultado de la operación por comprobar en Lamassu: no repitas automáticamente una emisión."},"888":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#comprueba-e-instala-el-resultado","content":"Para el caso de una raíz que emite directamente:"},"889":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#comprueba-e-instala-el-resultado","content":"Verifica además que el CN es el esperado, el certificado es final, los usos permiten tu aplicación y las fechas satisfacen el perfil. `cmp` debe terminar con código 0. Si hay intermedias, aporta la cadena con `-untrusted` según Validación PKI."},"890":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#comprueba-e-instala-el-resultado","content":"Consulta el dispositivo: DMS propietario, número de serie actual e historial deben corresponder al resultado. Guarda la pareja clave/certificado de forma protegida e instala ambos mediante el mecanismo del dispositivo. La asociación en Lamassu no instala archivos en el cliente. Comprueba una conexión real antes de considerar terminado el proceso."},"891":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#siguientes-pasos","content":"Implementa renovación y recuperación y la actualización de confianza. La referencia EST recoge endpoints, formatos y ServerKeyGen; el diagnóstico ayuda a distinguir errores de transporte, admisión y persistencia."},"892":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"page","content":"Referencia EST","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference"},"893":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","content":"Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu."},"894":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Referencia de endpoints"},"895":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#cacerts","content":"cacerts"},"896":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simpleenroll","content":"simpleenroll"},"897":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simplereenroll","content":"simplereenroll"},"898":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#serverkeygen","content":"serverkeygen"},"899":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"Formato de respuesta"},"900":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#solicitud-y-extracción","content":"Solicitud y extracción"},"901":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"Notas de compatibilidad"},"902":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","content":"Referencia del contrato del backend examinado, basada en RFC 7030. Utiliza Cliente EST para el procedimiento y DMS para configurar la política."},"903":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Ruta pública de los ejemplos: `/.well-known/est/{APS}/{operation}`. `APS` es el ID del DMS. El router admite rutas sin ese segmento, pero el controlador lo requiere; no las utilices como servicio predeterminado. La configuración del Gateway determina el host y la ruta públicos."},"904":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Operación"},"905":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Método"},"906":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Autenticación y condición"},"907":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"`/cacerts`"},"908":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"GET"},"909":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"La lectura DMS no exige credencial EST; HTTPS y controles de infraestructura siguen aplicándose."},"910":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"`/simpleenroll`"},"911":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"POST"},"912":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Autenticación inicial y política de registro/sustitución del DMS."},"913":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"`/simplereenroll`"},"914":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"POST"},"915":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Autenticación de renovación, identidad existente, sujeto, revocación y ventana."},"916":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"`/serverkeygen`"},"917":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"POST"},"918":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Autenticación y admisión iniciales; generación en servidor habilitada."},"919":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Estas rutas no implementan `/csrattrs` ni `/fullcmc`. No hay un modo EST nativo de autenticación JWT; un webhook puede interpretar una credencial de la petición según su propio contrato."},"920":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#cacerts","content":"La respuesta predeterminada tiene `Content-Type: application/pkcs7-mime; smime-type=certs-only` y `Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64`. El cuerpo es PKCS#7 DER en Base64 con líneas de hasta 76 caracteres. Incluye los certificados seleccionados por el DMS, no necesariamente todos los ascendientes."},"921":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-28","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#cacerts","content":"`Accept: application/x-pem-file` solicita el conjunto en PEM mediante una extensión de Lamassu. Su contenido debe inspeccionarse y aprobarse antes de modificar raíces confiables."},"922":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-29","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simpleenroll","content":"Envía una CSR PKCS#10 DER codificada en Base64, con `Content-Type: application/pkcs10`. El controlador examinado compara ese media type literalmente; evita añadir parámetros como charset. El CN identifica el dispositivo y la firma de la CSR debe verificarse mediante la política DMS."},"923":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-30","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simpleenroll","content":"La respuesta predeterminada usa el formato PKCS#7/Base64 descrito para cacerts, pero contiene el certificado emitido; no presupongas que incluye toda su cadena. `Accept: application/x-pem-file` devuelve ese certificado en PEM. El cliente conserva la clave que firmó la CSR."},"924":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-31","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simplereenroll","content":"Usa el mismo formato de solicitud y de certificado de respuesta. La autenticación se obtiene del bloque independiente `reenrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings`. Con certificado cliente, su CN debe coincidir con el CN de la CSR; también se comprueba el sujeto frente al certificado actual."},"925":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-32","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simplereenroll","content":"La CA de enrolamiento o una CA adicional valida la credencial en el modo mTLS. La comprobación de vencimiento por `enable_expired_renewal` corresponde a ese validador. El certificado actual revocado y una solicitud anterior a la ventana se rechazan. Consulta Renovación para instalación y recuperación."},"926":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-33","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#serverkeygen","content":"El servidor genera una clave software, reconstruye la CSR con esa clave y ejecuta el enrolamiento inicial. El flag debe estar habilitado y el algoritmo permitido por el perfil. La clave de esta operación no pasa a ser una clave hardware por utilizar una CA alojada en HSM."},"927":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-34","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#serverkeygen","content":"El código admite RSA y ECDSA de 224, 256, 384 o 521 bits. Un tamaño ECDSA no reconocido puede producir fallback a 256; elige explícitamente un tamaño compatible y comprueba la clave resultante. No reutilices un ID enrolado para probar esta operación sin revisar sustitución."},"928":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-35","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"El cuerpo es **MIME multipart/mixed**, con boundary indicado en `Content-Type`. Tiene dos partes:"},"929":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-36","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"Parte"},"930":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-37","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"Contenido tras decodificar su Base64"},"931":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-38","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"`application/pkcs8`"},"932":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-39","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"Clave privada PKCS#8 DER sin cifrar."},"933":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-40","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"`application/pkcs7-mime; smime-type=certs-only`"},"934":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-41","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"PKCS#7 DER con el certificado emitido."},"935":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-42","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"El controlador también añade `Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64` en la cabecera exterior, aunque el cuerpo exterior es texto MIME. &#x2A;*No decodifiques el cuerpo completo como Base64.** Lee el boundary real y decodifica cada parte según sus cabeceras."},"936":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-43","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#solicitud-y-extracción","content":"En una sesión Bash con `set -euo pipefail` y `umask 077`, utiliza `EST_BASE` y los archivos de confianza/bootstrap de Cliente EST. Elige `est-serverkeygen-001` libre y admitido. La clave `server-request.key` solo firma la CSR de entrada; la identidad recibida utilizará la clave generada por el servidor."},"937":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-44","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#solicitud-y-extracción","content":"Guarda este extractor Python 3. Valida las dos partes antes de escribir y rechaza archivos de salida existentes:"},"938":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-45","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#solicitud-y-extracción","content":"Convierte y comprueba el resultado:"},"939":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-46","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#solicitud-y-extracción","content":"Inspecciona CN, serie, fechas y usos; comprueba la asociación en Lamassu antes de instalar. Protege los archivos DER y PEM que contienen la clave y elimina copias temporales según el almacenamiento del dispositivo. Consulta openssl-pkcs8 y el parser MIME de Python."},"940":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-47","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"No interpretes cualquier 500 como un fallo transitorio. La entrada inválida suele producir 400; rechazos y errores del servicio suelen producir 500 con un cuerpo JSON `err`. Los errores de Gateway y algunos caminos del controlador pueden tener otro formato. Conserva cabeceras y cuerpo antes de decodificar y consulta el diagnóstico."},"941":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-48","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"Los ejemplos utilizan openssl-pkcs7 para extraer certificados y openssl-x509 para preparar renovación. Comprueba capacidades y respuestas de tu versión antes de integrar un cliente EST genérico."},"942":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"page","content":"Enrolamiento con PKI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview"},"943":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","content":"Elige la política de admisión y conecta DMS, confianza inicial y cliente EST."},"944":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"El recorrido"},"945":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-administrador","content":"Para el administrador"},"946":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-integrador","content":"Para el integrador"},"947":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#versión-del-contrato","content":"Versión del contrato"},"948":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","content":"Enrollment with PKI reúne el recorrido desde la admisión del dispositivo hasta la instalación y renovación de su identidad. El DMS actúa como autoridad de registro: autentica la solicitud, aplica la política de registro y pide a la CA que firme. El cliente conserva o recibe la clave, instala el resultado y lo presenta al consumidor."},"949":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"El administrador prepara CA, perfil de emisión y DMS."},"950":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"El integrador instala confianza inicial en el servidor EST y una credencial de admisión."},"951":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"El cliente solicita una identidad para su `Device ID` mediante EST."},"952":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"Se comprueban certificado, vinculación al dispositivo e instalación de la pareja clave/certificado."},"953":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"El consumidor valida y autoriza la identidad; el cliente programa renovación y recuperación."},"954":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"EST utiliza `/.well-known/est/{DMS_ID}`. Las APIs administrativas y la asignación manual siguen siendo recorridos distintos. Enrola y conecta un dispositivo completa una primera prueba con mTLS."},"955":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-administrador","content":"<Card title=\"Estrategias de aprovisionamiento\" description=\"Elige registro automático, prerregistro o asignación manual.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies\" />"},"956":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-administrador","content":"<Card title=\"Configura el DMS\" description=\"Separa admisión, autenticación por operación, perfil y distribución.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms\" />"},"957":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-administrador","content":"<Card title=\"Identidad inicial y autenticación\" description=\"Decide qué prueba permite solicitar la primera identidad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity\" />"},"958":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-administrador","content":"<Card title=\"Distribución de confianza\" description=\"Actualiza raíces y cadenas con un solapamiento comprobado.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution\" />"},"959":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-integrador","content":"<Card title=\"Cliente EST\" description=\"Prepara la solicitud, verifica la respuesta e instala la identidad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client\" />"},"960":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-integrador","content":"<Card title=\"Renovación y recuperación\" description=\"Genera el sucesor y trata credenciales vencidas o perdidas.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery\" />"},"961":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-integrador","content":"<Card title=\"Referencia EST\" description=\"Consulta rutas, formatos, autenticación y ServerKeyGen.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference\" />"},"962":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-integrador","content":"<Card title=\"Diagnóstico\" description=\"Distingue fallos de transporte, política, emisión e instalación.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting\" />"},"963":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#versión-del-contrato","content":"Este bloque describe el código de `main` examinado en el commit `8f42c47157f9a36bac3ed5caa3692aebebe19c4b`. El catálogo del sitio publica `main (unstable)`; no se atribuye este comportamiento a una release estable. Antes de utilizar otra versión, comprueba su contrato y migraciones, especialmente la autenticación independiente de reenrolamiento. Las comprobaciones de cliente y las pruebas contra una instancia se distinguen en el plan de revisión."},"964":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#versión-del-contrato","content":"La configuración del Gateway, TLS, proveedores y servicios pertenece a Despliegue. El uso de la identidad en AWS u otros destinos corresponde a Integraciones."},"965":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"page","content":"Estrategias de aprovisionamiento","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies"},"966":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","content":"Elige cómo se registra el dispositivo, quién autoriza su identidad y dónde se genera la clave."},"967":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Elige el registro"},"968":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#prerregistro-y-sustitución","content":"Prerregistro y sustitución"},"969":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"Elige la autenticación"},"970":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Elige la custodia"},"971":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#comprueba-la-decisión","content":"Comprueba la decisión"},"972":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","content":"Esta guía ayuda al administrador de aprovisionamiento a elegir un recorrido antes de configurar el DMS. Separa tres decisiones: cuándo existe el dispositivo, cómo se autoriza la solicitud y quién genera su clave. Ninguna de ellas concede por sí sola acceso en el destino."},"973":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Recorrido"},"974":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Cuándo existe el dispositivo"},"975":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Qué compruebas"},"976":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Asignación manual"},"977":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"El operador lo crea antes de asociar un certificado."},"978":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"ID, DMS propietario, CN del certificado y serie vinculada."},"979":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"EST con `JITP`"},"980":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Se crea para un CN desconocido durante `/simpleenroll`."},"981":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Credencial autorizada, ID libre, perfil, alta e identidad resultantes."},"982":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"EST con `PRE_REGISTRATION`"},"983":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Debe existir antes de `/simpleenroll`."},"984":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Registro aprobado, mismo DMS y condiciones de sustitución de tu versión."},"985":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"`JITP` de Lamassu crea inventario e identidad en Lamassu. JITP de AWS aprovisiona un destino en AWS; son decisiones diferentes."},"986":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-el-registro","content":"Para una primera prueba desde el cliente, utiliza Enrola y conecta un dispositivo. Para preparar inventario sin EST, sigue Registro manual."},"987":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#prerregistro-y-sustitución","content":"En el código examinado, encontrar cualquier dispositivo del mismo DMS activa el control `enable_replaceable_enrollment` antes de comprobar PRE\\_REGISTRATION. Con el flag desactivado, un dispositivo prerregistrado puede recibir `forbiddenNewEnrollment` incluso estando en **No Identity**. No se presenta ese recorrido como garantizado por seleccionar únicamente PRE\\_REGISTRATION."},"988":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#prerregistro-y-sustitución","content":"Activar el flag permite repetir `/simpleenroll` para un ID existente. El backend programa un intento diferido de revocación del certificado anterior con `Superseded`; también puede ejecutarlo si después falla la emisión o vinculación. Si no había identidad, el intento puede fallar por falta de serie. El flag no es una transacción de sustitución ni garantiza restaurar el estado anterior."},"989":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#prerregistro-y-sustitución","content":"Prueba el caso exacto de tu versión antes de habilitarlo en una población. Para una identidad ya operativa y una renovación autorizada, utiliza `/simplereenroll`; para recuperar una identidad, sigue Renovación y recuperación y confirma el estado persistido antes de reintentar."},"990":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"Decide por separado primer enrolamiento y reenrolamiento:"},"991":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"**Certificado cliente:** útil cuando cada equipo dispone de una credencial inicial cuya clave controla."},"992":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"**Webhook:** útil cuando otra autoridad conoce inventario, credenciales o derecho a solicitar un ID."},"993":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"**Certificado y webhook:** exige ambos controles en la operación configurada."},"994":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-28","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"**NO\\_AUTH:** no acredita al solicitante; solo encaja cuando el control de admisión se resuelve de forma deliberada fuera de ese DMS."},"995":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-29","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-autenticación","content":"Autenticar un certificado inicial no demuestra por sí solo el derecho a elegir cualquier CN en la CSR. Define esa autorización en Identidad inicial y autenticación."},"996":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-30","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Opción"},"997":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-31","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Material que atraviesa EST"},"998":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-32","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Clave generada por el dispositivo"},"999":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-33","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"CSR pública y certificado; la clave permanece en el cliente."},"1000":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-34","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Clave ya disponible en el dispositivo"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-35","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"CSR firmada con la clave existente y certificado nuevo."},"1002":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-36","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"ServerKeyGen"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-37","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Clave privada PKCS#8 y certificado en una respuesta multipart protegida por TLS."},"1004":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-38","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#elige-la-custodia","content":"Elegir ServerKeyGen no utiliza automáticamente el HSM o KMS de la CA para la clave del dispositivo. Revisa su contrato y extracción y la capacidad del dispositivo para instalar el material."},"1005":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies-39","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies#comprueba-la-decisión","content":"Antes de extender el flujo, prueba alta permitida, credencial incorrecta, ID de otro DMS, solicitud repetida y recuperación tras un fallo. Conserva ID, serie, versión activa y error. Comprueba también aceptación y rechazo en el consumidor; un certificado emitido no implica que el destino lo conozca o permita operar."},"1006":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"page","content":"Renovación y recuperación","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","content":"Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real."},"1008":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepara-la-renovación","content":"Prepara la renovación"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#solicita-el-certificado-sucesor","content":"Solicita el certificado sucesor"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#instala-y-comprueba-la-nueva-pareja","content":"Instala y comprueba la nueva pareja"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Recupera según el estado"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#operación-continua","content":"Operación continua"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","content":"La renovación conserva el identificador del dispositivo y solicita un certificado sucesor. Es un proceso que debe completar el cliente: comprobar la respuesta, instalar la pareja correspondiente y demostrar que el consumidor la acepta. Las alertas de Lamassu avisan; no ejecutan esos pasos."},"1014":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepara-la-renovación","content":"Consulta el certificado actual en Lamassu y compáralo con el instalado. Necesitas su sujeto, serie y fechas, además de la clave del cliente."},"1015":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepara-la-renovación","content":"Comprueba el modo de autenticación de **re-enrollment**: es independiente del inicial. En `CLIENT_CERTIFICATE`, utiliza la identidad actual, no asumas que la credencial bootstrap está admitida."},"1016":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepara-la-renovación","content":"Calcula el inicio de la ventana: `NotAfter` del certificado actual menos `reenrollment_delta`. Los umbrales preventivo y crítico producen estados/avisos; no amplían esa ventana."},"1017":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#prepara-la-renovación","content":"Revisa **Revoke on Re-enrollment** y la recuperación si la instalación falla. Si está habilitado, Lamassu puede revocar la identidad anterior antes de que el cliente instale la nueva."},"1018":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#solicita-el-certificado-sucesor","content":"El ejemplo continúa el tutorial EST, en la misma sesión Bash con `set -euo pipefail`, `umask 077` y `EST_BASE`. Usa una nueva clave compatible con el perfil. La conversión desde el certificado conserva el sujeto y copia solo SAN cuando existe; comprueba el sujeto y los nombres solicitados antes de enviarla. El backend comprueba el sujeto frente a la identidad actual: intenta igualdad de RawSubject y después compara CN, OU, O, L, ST y C. Volver a construir únicamente el CN puede perder atributos requeridos."},"1019":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#solicita-el-certificado-sucesor","content":"La petición se autentica con `device.crt` y `device.key`; la CSR contiene la clave pública nueva. Comprueba también extensiones, fechas y correspondencia de serie con el slot actual en Lamassu. No vuelvas a enviar una solicitud que falló sin consultar ese estado: la emisión, la revocación anterior y la vinculación del sucesor pueden tener resultados parciales."},"1020":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#instala-y-comprueba-la-nueva-pareja","content":"Conserva el resultado como `device.next.crt` y `device.next.key` hasta verificarlo. Cambia la pareja mediante una operación coordinada del almacén o configuración del dispositivo; evita exponer temporalmente un certificado con la clave de otra versión."},"1021":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#instala-y-comprueba-la-nueva-pareja","content":"Prueba mTLS con el consumidor y verifica que utiliza la nueva serie. Confirma el historial y el certificado actual en Lamassu. Si **Revoke on Re-enrollment** estaba deshabilitado, la identidad anterior puede seguir válida: retírala conforme a la política de PKI después de probar el sucesor y comprueba la publicación y consumo de su revocación."},"1022":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#instala-y-comprueba-la-nueva-pareja","content":"Si la identidad anterior ya está revocada, conservar sus archivos no permite restaurar una conexión válida. La recuperación requiere una credencial admitida y una intervención autorizada según la situación."},"1023":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Situación"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Procedimiento"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Certificado vigente, fuera de ventana"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Programa la solicitud dentro de la ventana. No recurras a `simpleenroll` para saltarla."},"1027":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Certificado vencido, clave disponible"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Con autenticación por certificado, revisa `enable_expired_renewal` y que Gateway permita presentar esa credencial. Siguen aplicándose revocación, sujeto y el resto de comprobaciones."},"1029":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Renovación por webhook o `NO_AUTH`"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"La comprobación mTLS de vencimiento no se ejecuta en esos modos. Define la política de vencimiento y autorización en la admisión correspondiente; el flag no constituye una prohibición universal."},"1031":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Clave perdida o inaccesible"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"No puedes probar posesión de la identidad anterior. Autoriza una nueva admisión y, si procede, sustitución controlada; revoca la identidad comprometida."},"1033":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Identidad actual revocada"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"`simplereenroll` rechaza el certificado actual revocado. Investiga la razón y prepara un procedimiento de readmisión autorizado; no desactives autenticación para forzarlo."},"1035":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-28","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Dispositivo sin identidad"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-29","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Usa el enrolamiento inicial. En un registro existente, comprueba la restricción de sustitución de aprovisionamiento."},"1037":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-30","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Dispositivo retirado"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-31","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Revisa la decisión operativa antes de readmitirlo. El estado Decommissioned y la revocación de todo el historial no son equivalentes."},"1039":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-32","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Timeout, HTTP 500 o fallo de instalación"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-33","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#recupera-según-el-estado","content":"Inspecciona dispositivo, certificados emitidos e historial antes de reintentar. Puede haberse emitido un sucesor o revocado el anterior."},"1041":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-34","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#operación-continua","content":"Programa las renovaciones con margen para desconexiones, distribución de confianza y comprobación del consumidor. Escalona solicitudes de la población y limita los reintentos dentro de la ventana; los errores de autenticación, sujeto o política requieren corregir su causa. Conserva un mecanismo de recuperación admitido y probado para las claves perdidas y las parejas que no pudieron instalarse."},"1042":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery-35","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery#operación-continua","content":"Continúa con Distribución de confianza, Dispositivos e identidades y Diagnóstico."},"1043":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Diagnóstico de enrolamiento","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","content":"Localiza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emisión e instalación."},"1045":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#diagnóstico-y-compatibilidad","content":"Diagnóstico y compatibilidad"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Códigos de error y diagnóstico"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"Notas de compatibilidad"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"El enrolamiento EST falla"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnostica una operación y un dispositivo cada vez. Anota DMS/APS, endpoint, hora, código HTTP, serie presentada y CN de la CSR. Conserva la respuesta sin incluir claves privadas ni credenciales de webhook en el informe."},"1050":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"El controlador EST devuelve normalmente 400 al rechazar entrada y 500 cuando el servicio rechaza o falla la operación. Un 500 también puede representar una denegación de política; no implica que reintentar sea seguro. Gateway puede generar sus propios códigos y cuerpos. Revisa el cuerpo real y el resultado persistido."},"1051":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Síntoma o mensaje"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Qué revisar"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"curl rechaza TLS, nombre o emisor"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"URL, reloj, SAN del servidor y raíz aprobada en `est-trust.pem`. Resolver la confianza en Despliegue; no omitir la verificación."},"1055":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"404 o APS ausente"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Ruta pública `/.well-known/est/{DMS_ID}/{operation}` y DMS existente. El APS no es el nombre del servicio."},"1057":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"400, error de CSR o formato"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`Content-Type: application/pkcs10`, Base64 de DER, firma válida y cuerpo conservado sin doble codificación."},"1059":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Credencial ausente o certificado no válido"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Modo de la operación, CA validante, fechas, revocación y entrega de la credencial por Gateway. No confundir confianza TLS del servidor con CA de bootstrap."},"1061":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Webhook deniega, expira o responde sin autorización"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Configuración, conectividad y respuesta JSON con `authorized: true`. No hay degradación automática a `NO_AUTH`."},"1063":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`device not preregistered`"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"PRE\\_REGISTRATION requiere la entrada de inventario previa."},"1065":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`forbiddenNewEnrollment`"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Un dispositivo ya existente exige sustitución habilitada, incluso en No Identity. Investiga antes de activar el flag."},"1067":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"DMS propietario distinto"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"CN/ID, inventario global y DMS dueño; no reutilices un ID de otro contexto."},"1069":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`invalid RawSubject bytes`"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Sujeto de la CSR frente al certificado actual. Conserva sus atributos, además del CN."},"1071":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`invalid reenroll window`"},"1072":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"NotAfter de la identidad actual y reenrollment\\_delta. Los umbrales de alerta no cambian esa ventana."},"1073":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Certificado actual revocado"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Renovación rechazada; prepara recuperación autorizada según la causa."},"1075":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Error de CA, perfil o firma"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"CA activa, clave disponible, perfil seleccionado y restricciones. Un cacerts correcto no prueba emisión."},"1077":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"HTTP 200 sin conexión del dispositivo"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Pareja instalada, cadena, usos, confianza y permisos del consumidor. Comprueba también el slot e historial."},"1079":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Timeout o error después de emitir"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Certificados nuevos, slot actual y estado de la identidad anterior antes de repetir."},"1081":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"Los ejemplos usan el contrato del backend examinado. No atribuyas automáticamente ese comportamiento a otra release. Verifica el modo de renovación guardado tras una migración y el comportamiento del Gateway con certificados vencidos y con la CA inicial."},"1082":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"La respuesta predeterminada es PKCS#7 DER en Base64; el PEM por `Accept: application/x-pem-file` es una extensión de Lamassu. ServerKeyGen devuelve multipart y requiere tratar cada parte por separado. Consulta la referencia EST."},"1083":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"Comprueba HTTPS con la raíz aprobada y consulta cacerts para el APS correcto."},"1084":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"Revisa el DMS guardado: protocolo, registro, autenticación de esa operación, CA, perfil y ventana."},"1085":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"Verifica la CSR localmente y relaciona su CN con el inventario."},"1086":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"Ejecuta una solicitud, guarda cabeceras/cuerpo y consulta el dispositivo y los certificados."},"1087":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"Si recibes identidad, comprueba clave, sujeto, uso y conexión con el consumidor."},"1088":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"Las comprobaciones externas de revocación del bootstrap tienen límites: ausencia de evidencia puede aceptarse, y OCSP Unknown no produce el mismo rechazo que Revoked. No presupongas una política de rechazo ante cualquier incertidumbre. Una CA intermedia en la cadena TLS tampoco demuestra que toda la cadena haya llegado al validador DMS."},"1089":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"Para logs, red, pods o cabeceras de Gateway, continúa en Diagnóstico de Despliegue. Para identidades emitidas, revocadas o vinculadas parcialmente, utiliza Renovación y recuperación y Dispositivos e identidades."},"1090":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"page","content":"Distribución y actualización de confianza","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution"},"1091":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","content":"Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados."},"1092":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Tres relaciones de confianza"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#qué-devuelve-cacerts","content":"Qué devuelve cacerts"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Instala lo necesario"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migra-la-confianza","content":"Migra la confianza"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#comprueba-la-actualización","content":"Comprueba la actualización"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","content":"Esta guía se dirige a quien administra la confianza de dispositivos y consumidores. Necesitas inventario de emisores, acceso a los almacenes de confianza y un canal autenticado de actualización. Distribuir certificados es distinto de decidir cuáles serán anclas confiables."},"1098":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Relación"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Material que prepara el responsable"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Dispositivo → servidor EST"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Raíz, cadena o pin previamente verificado del servidor y su nombre TLS."},"1102":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"DMS → solicitante"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"CAs y reglas que autorizan la credencial inicial o de renovación."},"1104":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Consumidor → dispositivo"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Raíces de la identidad operativa, intermedias, validación y permisos."},"1106":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#tres-relaciones-de-confianza","content":"Un dispositivo que obtiene un certificado no configura automáticamente ninguna de esas relaciones en terceros. Revisa el modelo de confianza."},"1107":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#qué-devuelve-cacerts","content":"El DMS puede incluir el certificado TLS downstream disponible, las Managed CAs elegidas y la CA de enrolamiento. No incorpora todos los ascendientes por seleccionar la emisora. El conjunto puede contener hojas, raíces e intermedias, incluso más de una jerarquía durante una migración."},"1108":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#qué-devuelve-cacerts","content":"La posición no define la cadena. Identifica cada certificado por sujeto, emisor, AKI/SKI, firma y restricciones. Descarga e inspecciona con Cliente EST."},"1109":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Mantén por separado la confianza inicial del servidor EST y la del consumidor de identidades."},"1110":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Selecciona raíces que tu política haya aprobado como anclas."},"1111":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Conserva intermedias para construir o presentar cadenas; no las conviertas automáticamente en raíces."},"1112":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Presenta hoja e intermedias requeridas en mTLS. Normalmente no necesitas enviar la raíz al interlocutor que ya confía en ella."},"1113":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"Verifica cadena, fechas, nombres, usos y revocación desde el consumidor."},"1114":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#instala-lo-necesario","content":"No uses indiscriminadamente todo `cacerts.pem` como `-CAfile`: eso puede ampliar el conjunto de autoridades confiadas, ocultar intermedias faltantes o confiar una hoja TLS que tenía otra finalidad."},"1115":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migra-la-confianza","content":"Antes de cambiar Enrollment CA, inventaría equipos desconectados, bootstrap, certificados operativos y consumidores. Distribuye la nueva raíz y las intermedias necesarias; comprueba que una cohorte acepta cadenas antigua y nueva."},"1116":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migra-la-confianza","content":"En el DMS, separa las CAs distribuidas de `additional_validation_cas`, utilizadas para la credencial de reenrolamiento. El validador examinado prueba la CA de enrolamiento y después esas CAs con la hoja recibida; aceptar una cadena multinivel requiere verificar cómo llega al servicio y qué emisor está configurado."},"1117":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#migra-la-confianza","content":"Cambia emisión, renueva por grupos y compara la serie instalada con el slot activo. Retira la confianza anterior cuando ningún equipo legítimo la necesite y tu política permita cerrar el solapamiento. Sigue Jerarquía y rotación para la operación PKI."},"1118":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution#comprueba-la-actualización","content":"Prueba una identidad antigua permitida durante el solapamiento, una nueva, una cadena desconocida y el resultado después de retirar la confianza antigua. Conserva versión del almacén, conjunto aprobado, fecha y resultado. `/cacerts` accesible solo demuestra distribución; no demuestra instalación ni aceptación por todos los dispositivos."},"1119":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"page","content":"AWS IoT Core","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Integraciones"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-0","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos."},"1121":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-1","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Arquitectura del conector"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-2","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#prerrequisitos","content":"Prerrequisitos"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-3","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Permisos IAM necesarios"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-4","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#parámetros-de-configuración","content":"Parámetros de configuración"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-5","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#registro-de-la-ca-en-aws-iot-core","content":"Registro de la CA en AWS IoT Core"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-6","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#cómo-solicitar-el-registro","content":"Cómo solicitar el registro"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-7","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#primary-account","content":"Primary Account"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-8","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#secondary-account-sni-only","content":"Secondary Account (SNI-only)"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-9","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#configuración-del-dms","content":"Configuración del DMS"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-10","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#modo-none","content":"Modo `none`"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-11","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#modo-auto","content":"Modo `auto`"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-12","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#modo-jitp","content":"Modo `jitp`"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-13","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#aprovisionamiento-de-dispositivos-modo-automático","content":"Aprovisionamiento de dispositivos (modo automático)"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-14","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#aprovisionamiento-de-dispositivos-modo-jitp","content":"Aprovisionamiento de dispositivos (modo JITP)"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-15","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#sincronización-del-estado-del-certificado","content":"Sincronización del estado del certificado"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-16","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#desconexión-forzada-al-revocar","content":"Desconexión forzada al revocar"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-17","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#device-shadow-y-automatización","content":"Device Shadow y automatización"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-18","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#qué-escribe-el-conector-en-el-shadow","content":"Qué escribe el conector en el shadow"},"1139":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-19","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#políticas-de-aws-iot","content":"Políticas de AWS IoT"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-20","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#solución-de-problemas","content":"Solución de problemas"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-21","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"La integración de Lamassu con AWS IoT Core cubre el puente entre la PKI gestionada por Lamassu y la plataforma de conectividad de AWS. Cuando un dispositivo obtiene su certificado a través del proceso de enrolamiento EST, el conector se encarga de que ese certificado y la identidad asociada sean reconocidos en AWS IoT Core sin intervención manual. El resultado es que el dispositivo puede autenticarse directamente en AWS con el mismo certificado X.509 que Lamassu emitió."},"1142":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-22","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"Desde el punto de vista del protocolo, el dispositivo se autentica ante AWS IoT Core mediante TLS mutuo (mTLS): presenta su certificado X.509 emitido por Lamassu como certificado de cliente, y AWS IoT Core verifica la cadena de certificados hasta llegar a la CA registrada en la cuenta. Lamassu actúa como autoridad de certificación (CA); el conector se encarga de que esa CA esté registrada en AWS y de que el certificado del dispositivo sea conocido por la plataforma antes de que el dispositivo intente conectarse (en modo `auto`) o en su primera conexión (en modo JITP)."},"1143":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-23","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"Este documento está dirigido tanto al administrador PKI, que necesita configurar el conector y registrar las CAs, como al desarrollador de firmware de dispositivos, que necesita entender cómo se nombran los Things, cómo funciona el Device Shadow y qué ocurre cuando un certificado se revoca. Para el desarrollador de firmware, el dato más importante es que el **nombre del Thing en AWS (ThingName) corresponde siempre al Common Name (CN) del certificado emitido por Lamassu**, independientemente del modo de aprovisionamiento."},"1144":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-24","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"El conector de AWS IoT Core es un proceso Go independiente, un binario o contenedor separado del núcleo de Lamassu. En un despliegue monolítico se compila por defecto (etiqueta de compilación `!noaws`) y se activa mediante `aws_iot_manager.enabled: true` en el fichero de configuración. En despliegues distribuidos, se ejecuta como un contenedor propio con acceso a los servicios de CA, DMS Manager y Device Manager de Lamassu a través de HTTP."},"1145":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-25","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"El conector no sondea los servicios de Lamassu periódicamente. En su lugar, **se suscribe al bus de eventos interno** de Lamassu (AMQP o AWS SQS/SNS, configurable) y reacciona a los eventos que le interesan: creación o actualización de CAs, creación o actualización de DMS, vinculación de identidad de dispositivo, cambio de estado de certificado, actualización de metadatos de certificado y actualización de metadatos de dispositivo. Este modelo orientado a eventos garantiza que la sincronización con AWS sea casi inmediata y no genere carga de sondeo."},"1146":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-26","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Para evitar bucles infinitos, el conector ignora cualquier evento cuyo campo `source` de CloudEvent coincida con su propia URI de origen. Esto previene que las escrituras de metadatos que el propio conector realiza vuelvan a disparar el mismo flujo."},"1147":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-27","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Cuando se ejecutan varios conectores en paralelo, por ejemplo, para distintas cuentas de AWS, cada instancia tiene su propio `connector_id`. Todos los metadatos que el conector escribe en Lamassu se almacenan bajo la clave `lamassu.io/iot/{connector_id}`, lo que permite coexistencia sin colisiones."},"1148":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-28","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#prerrequisitos","content":"Antes de activar el conector es necesario disponer de una cuenta AWS con los permisos IAM adecuados y tener el conector correctamente configurado. El proceso de despliegue (Docker Compose, Kubernetes o binario) se describe en la documentación de despliegue."},"1149":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-29","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"La identidad IAM con la que opera el conector debe tener al mínimo los siguientes permisos sobre los recursos de la cuenta destino:"},"1150":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-30","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Acción IAM"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-31","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Propósito"},"1152":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-32","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#