un mensaje o sobre un *digest* ya calculado."},"2027":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management-90","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management#sign","content":"Campos principales:"},"2028":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management-91","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management#sign","content":"**Algorithm**: algoritmo de firma disponible para el tipo de clave."},"2029":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management-92","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management#sign","content":"**Message Type**: `Raw` para datos en claro o `Digest` para un hash precalculado."},"2030":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management-93","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management#sign","content":"**Payload Encoding**: codificación de entrada, como UTF-8, Hex o Base64."},"2031":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management-94","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management#sign","content":"**Message**: contenido que se va a firmar."},"2032":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management-95","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management#sign","content":"**Signature**: resultado de la operación, mostrado en hexadecimal."},"2033":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management-96","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management#verify","content":"Esta pestaña comprueba si una firma corresponde a la clave pública asociada."},"2034":{"id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management-97","page_id":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/platform/pki/key-management#verify","con